meta {
  name: List platform users
  type: http
  seq: 8
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/platform/users
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  ~q: 
  ~status: active
  ~role: 
  ~sort: 
  ~limit: 50
  ~cursor: 
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.data: isDefined
}

docs {
  `GET /v1/platform/users`

  Platform-staff read; the principal must hold the stated capability on the platform plane. Responses are projected (consent-aware).

  - **Auth:** Bearer access token (`{{accessToken}}`, set by `auth/Login`)
  - **Capabilities:** `users:view`
  - **Listeners:** internal
  - **Success:** `200`; `data` is a list of objects with `id`, `email`, `displayName`, `status`, `memberships`, `platformRoles`; `nextCursor` pages
  - **Query `q`**: Search text
  - **Query `status`**: Status filter
  - **Query `role`**: Role filter
  - **Query `sort`**: Sort order
  - **Query `limit`**: Page size (positive integer)
  - **Query `cursor`**: Opaque cursor from the previous page's nextCursor
}
